    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Understand Run Scope",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 2
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "html",
        "content": "<div style=\"padding:6px 10px;border-left:4px solid #ff9830;background:rgba(255,152,48,0.08);font-size:16px;line-height:1.35;white-space:normal;overflow-wrap:anywhere\"><div style=\"max-width:96ch\"><div style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:700\">Which exact run should be inspected?</div><div><b>Scope:</b> <b>BROWSE</b> = recent runs · <b>SELECTED RUN</b> = identity/accounting/actions</div><div><b>FULL PATHS</b> = report artifacts, not triage bodies</div><div style=\"margin-top:6px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.4\"><b>Fail-closed empty state:</b> default <code>pipeline=unknown</code> and <code>run_id=-</code> intentionally show no runs (not a missing data store). Select a real pipeline from the dropdown (e.g. <code>chembl_assay</code>, <code>chembl_activity</code>), keep <code>run_type</code> compatible (often <code>backfill</code>), then pick a concrete <code>run_id</code> (not <code>-</code>). Expand <b>Selected Run Details</b> for funnel/reasons/artifacts.</div></div></div>"
      },
      "description": "Run Explorer has two modes. Browse mode lists recent run-report artifacts for the selected pipeline. Selected-run mode uses BioETL Ops HTTP to show identity, accounting, reasons, reconciliation, and artifacts for one exact run. Run ID is never a Prometheus label. Full filesystem paths belong to report-artifact Open/Copy actions, not scan-oriented cells."
    },
    {
      "id": 3010,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Browse Recent Runs (last 20)",
      "description": "Browse mode: Recent pipeline-run reports found on disk for the selected pipeline. Choose a row to set the run ID and open exact-run evidence. An empty table is valid when no matching reports exist. If reports are expected, treat backend unavailable as a distinct failure state and verify BioETL Ops HTTP at /health/live. Empty table: no matching reports under reports/run-reports/pipeline/<name>/. Has reports: chembl_assay, chembl_target, chembl_publication. chembl_activity may appear in run_id (control-plane) but has no report artifacts yet. If the host has reports and this is empty: bind mismatch — python -m scripts.ops.runtime.docker.verify_report_bind Index is bounded to the last 20 pipeline-run-report artifacts (limit=20). Older runs are omitted by design; they are not a missing backend.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "datasource": "BioETL Ops HTTP",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "left",
            "inspect": true
          },
          "noValue": "No pipeline-run-report artifacts under reports/run-reports/pipeline/<name>/ (index is last 20)."
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "^(Value|#Value|Value \\(.*\\)|value|Value #.*)$"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "displayName",
                "value": "Count"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "completed_at"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "dateTimeAsIso"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        },
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "format": "table",
          "parser": "backend",
          "refId": "A",
          "root_selector": "items",
          "source": "url",
          "type": "json",
          "url": "/ops/observability/pipeline-run-reports?pipeline=${pipeline}&limit=20",
          "url_options": {
            "data": "",
            "method": "GET"
          },
          "expr": ""
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "json_path": true,
              "markdown_path": true,
              "path": true,
              "report_path": true,
              "artifact_path": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "completed_at": "Completed",
              "run_id": "Run",
              "pipeline": "Pipeline",
              "status": "Status",
              "kind": "Artifact",
              "name": "Artifact"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
